{
  "$schema": "./recipe-schema.json",
  "meta": {
    "schemaVersion": "3.1.0",
    "component": "modal",
    "version": "2.0.0",
    "status": "stable",
    "tags": [
      "overlay",
      "interactive",
      "dialog"
    ],
    "links": {
      "figma": "",
      "storybook": "",
      "docs": "/docs/modal-docs"
    },
    "layer": "organism",
    "pipeline": {
      "scss": [
        "scss/scss/07-organisms/_modal.scss"
      ],
      "story": "stories/organisms/modal.stories.js",
      "arena": "apps/theme-configurator/src/components/laboratory/RecipeArena.vue",
      "drupal": [],
      "docs": "docs/modal-docs.html"
    }
  },
  "anatomy": {
    "root": {
      "element": ".nc-modal"
    },
    "slots": [
      {
        "name": "header",
        "element": ".nc-modal__header",
        "optional": true
      },
      {
        "name": "title",
        "element": ".nc-modal__title",
        "optional": true
      },
      {
        "name": "header-icon",
        "element": ".nc-modal__header-icon",
        "optional": true
      },
      {
        "name": "close",
        "element": ".nc-modal__close",
        "optional": true
      },
      {
        "name": "body",
        "element": ".nc-modal__body",
        "optional": false
      },
      {
        "name": "footer",
        "element": ".nc-modal__footer",
        "optional": true
      }
    ],
    "convenience": [],
    "domNotes": [
      "Root: natives <dialog> Element. showModal() fuer modale Anzeige.",
      "Verwendet --nc-dialog-* Tokens (geteilt mit Alert-Dialog fuer Overlay-Konsistenz).",
      "[open]: display:flex. Zentriert via fixed + margin:auto.",
      "Backdrop: ::backdrop mit overlay-bg Animation. Optional: Klick auf Backdrop schliesst via data-backdrop-close='true'. Nicht bei Formularen (Datenverlust).",
      "Oeffnungs-Animation: opacity + translate (16px hoch). @starting-style.",
      "Body Scroll Lock: body:has(.nc-modal[open]) { overflow: hidden }.",
      "Sticky Header/Footer: Bei --scrollable Modifier bleiben Header und Footer fixiert. JS setzt .is-scrolled-top/.is-scrolled-bottom auf .nc-modal basierend auf scrollTop des Body — Header/Footer zeigen dann eine subtile Border (nc-dialog-header-border-color / nc-dialog-footer-border-color) als Scroll-Indikator.",
      "Scroll-Detection JS Pattern: const body = modal.querySelector('.nc-modal__body'); body.addEventListener('scroll', () => { modal.classList.toggle('is-scrolled-top', body.scrollTop > 0); modal.classList.toggle('is-scrolled-bottom', body.scrollTop + body.clientHeight < body.scrollHeight); });",
      "Backdrop-Close JS Pattern: dialog.addEventListener('click', (e) => { if (e.target === dialog && dialog.dataset.backdropClose === 'true') dialog.close(); });",
      "Mobile Bottom-Sheet: Unter sm-Breakpoint gleitet das Modal von unten herein (translate: 0 100% → 0 0), volle Breite, abgerundete obere Ecken (nc-dialog-mobile-radius). Max-Hoehe begrenzt (nc-dialog-mobile-max-height: 90vh).",
      "Bottom-Sheet auf jeder Fensterbreite: Modifier nc-modal--sheet (Achse layout: sheet). Dieselben Regeln wie die automatische Umschaltung unter sm (SCSS-Mixin modal-bottom-sheet); die automatische Umschaltung bleibt. Entscheidung 02.10.2026.",
      "Overlay-Konsistenz: nc-dialog-bg = surface-elevated (wie Dropdown/Popover). nc-dialog-shadow = elevation-modal (Level 3, hoechster Schatten). Dropdown: elevation-floating (Level 1). Popover: elevation-overlay (Level 2).",
      "Danger-Intent: Header-Icon-Bereich und primaere Footer-Action uebernehmen danger-Markenfarbe. Visuelles Signal fuer destruktive Aktion.",
      "Close-Button: <button class='nc-modal__close' aria-label='Schliessen'>. 36px Target, focus-visible Ring."
    ]
  },
  "axes": {
    "size": {
      "label": "Size",
      "description": "Groesse — sm (400px), md (560px Standard), lg (720px), full (100%)",
      "values": {
        "sm": {
          "modifier": "nc-modal--sm",
          "tokenGroups": [],
          "renderHint": "modal-sm"
        },
        "md": {
          "modifier": null,
          "tokenGroups": [],
          "renderHint": "modal-md"
        },
        "lg": {
          "modifier": "nc-modal--lg",
          "tokenGroups": [],
          "renderHint": "modal-lg"
        },
        "full": {
          "modifier": "nc-modal--full",
          "tokenGroups": [],
          "renderHint": "modal-full"
        }
      }
    },
    "content": {
      "label": "Content",
      "description": "Inhaltsstruktur — simple (nur Body), with-header, with-footer, full (Header + Body + Footer), scrollable (voller Inhalt mit scrollbarem Body und sticky Header/Footer)",
      "values": {
        "simple": {
          "modifier": null,
          "tokenGroups": [],
          "renderHint": "modal-simple"
        },
        "with-header": {
          "modifier": null,
          "tokenGroups": [],
          "slotConfig": {
            "header": true,
            "title": true,
            "close": true
          },
          "renderHint": "modal-header"
        },
        "with-footer": {
          "modifier": null,
          "tokenGroups": [],
          "slotConfig": {
            "footer": true
          },
          "renderHint": "modal-footer"
        },
        "full": {
          "modifier": null,
          "tokenGroups": [],
          "slotConfig": {
            "header": true,
            "title": true,
            "close": true,
            "footer": true
          },
          "renderHint": "modal-full-content"
        },
        "scrollable": {
          "modifier": "nc-modal--scrollable",
          "tokenGroups": [
            "scroll-borders"
          ],
          "slotConfig": {
            "header": true,
            "title": true,
            "close": true,
            "footer": true
          },
          "renderHint": "modal-scrollable"
        }
      }
    },
    "intent": {
      "label": "Intent",
      "description": "Absicht — default (neutral, informativ), danger (destruktive Aktion wie Loeschen)",
      "values": {
        "default": {
          "modifier": null,
          "tokenGroups": [],
          "renderHint": "intent-default"
        },
        "danger": {
          "modifier": "nc-modal--danger",
          "tokenGroups": [
            "danger"
          ],
          "renderHint": "intent-danger"
        }
      }
    },
    "layout": {
      "label": "Layout",
      "description": "Darstellung — dialog (zentriert; unter dem sm-Breakpoint des Fensters automatisch Bottom-Sheet), sheet (Bottom-Sheet auf jeder Fensterbreite, nc-modal--sheet). Entscheidung 02.10.2026.",
      "values": {
        "dialog": {
          "modifier": null,
          "tokenGroups": [],
          "renderHint": "layout-dialog"
        },
        "sheet": {
          "modifier": "nc-modal--sheet",
          "tokenGroups": [
            "mobile"
          ],
          "renderHint": "layout-sheet"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "states": {
    "supported": [
      "default",
      "open"
    ],
    "precedence": [
      "open",
      "default"
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "state": "open",
        "unless": [],
        "note": "Open: display:flex, opacity:1, translate(0,0). Animation via @starting-style. Backdrop sichtbar."
      }
    ],
    "interactive": true
  },
  "a11y": {
    "base": {
      "interactive": true,
      "contrastTarget": "WCAG AA normal text (4.5:1)",
      "assertions": [
        "hasAccessibleName",
        "supportsKeyboard"
      ],
      "note": "Natives <dialog> liefert role='dialog', aria-modal='true' bei showModal(). aria-labelledby → Title. ESC schliesst nativ. Fokus-Trap ist nativ. Fokus kehrt zum Trigger zurueck."
    },
    "overrides": [
      {
        "when": {
          "axes": {
            "intent": [
              "danger"
            ]
          }
        },
        "suggest": [],
        "note": "Danger-Modal: Primaere Action (z.B. 'Loeschen') muss Label klar benennen. Farbe allein ist kein Signal. Optional: autofocus auf Cancel statt Confirm."
      },
      {
        "when": {
          "axes": {
            "content": [
              "scrollable"
            ]
          }
        },
        "suggest": [],
        "note": "Scrollable: Sticky Header/Footer informieren visuell via Border-Erscheinung. Kein A11y-Impact — Scroll ist nativ per Tastatur."
      }
    ]
  },
  "constraints": {
    "rules": [
      {
        "when": {},
        "require": [
          "dialog-element",
          "aria-labelledby"
        ],
        "notes": [
          "<dialog> mit showModal(). aria-labelledby auf den Titel."
        ]
      },
      {
        "when": {},
        "require": [
          "close-mechanism"
        ],
        "notes": [
          "Mindestens eine Schliess-Moeglichkeit: ESC (nativ), Close-Button, oder Backdrop-Klick."
        ]
      }
    ],
    "copy": {
      "title": {
        "maxChars": 60,
        "note": "Modal-Titel: 'Einstellungen', 'Neuen Eintrag erstellen', 'Datei hochladen'."
      },
      "dangerAction": {
        "maxChars": 30,
        "note": "Danger-Action: Klar benannt, z.B. 'Endgueltig loeschen', nicht nur 'OK'."
      }
    }
  },
  "styling": {
    "baseClasses": [
      "nc-modal"
    ],
    "baseTokenGroups": [
      "container",
      "header",
      "body",
      "footer",
      "close-button"
    ],
    "tokenGroups": {
      "container": {
        "label": "Container",
        "tokens": [
          "nc-dialog-max-width",
          "nc-dialog-max-height",
          "nc-dialog-padding",
          "nc-dialog-radius",
          "nc-dialog-bg",
          "nc-dialog-shadow",
          "nc-dialog-overlay-bg",
          "nc-dialog-section-gap"
        ]
      },
      "header": {
        "label": "Header",
        "tokens": [
          "nc-dialog-title-font-size",
          "nc-dialog-title-font-weight",
          "nc-dialog-title-color",
          "nc-dialog-header-gap",
          "nc-dialog-header-border-color"
        ]
      },
      "body": {
        "label": "Body",
        "tokens": [
          "nc-dialog-description-font-size",
          "nc-dialog-description-color"
        ]
      },
      "footer": {
        "label": "Footer",
        "tokens": [
          "nc-dialog-footer-gap",
          "nc-dialog-footer-border-color"
        ]
      },
      "close-button": {
        "label": "Close Button",
        "tokens": [
          "nc-dialog-close-size",
          "nc-dialog-close-radius",
          "nc-dialog-close-bg",
          "nc-dialog-close-bg-hover",
          "nc-dialog-close-icon-size"
        ]
      },
      "danger": {
        "label": "Danger Intent",
        "tokens": [
          "nc-dialog-danger-icon-color",
          "nc-dialog-danger-action-bg",
          "nc-dialog-danger-action-color"
        ]
      },
      "scroll-borders": {
        "label": "Scroll Borders",
        "tokens": [
          "nc-dialog-header-border-color",
          "nc-dialog-footer-border-color"
        ]
      },
      "mobile": {
        "label": "Mobile Bottom-Sheet",
        "tokens": [
          "nc-dialog-mobile-radius",
          "nc-dialog-mobile-max-height"
        ]
      }
    }
  },
  "recipes": {
    "mode": "derived",
    "derive": {
      "from": [
        "axes",
        "states",
        "styling.tokenGroups"
      ],
      "output": [
        "classList",
        "resolvedTokens",
        "a11yAssertions"
      ]
    },
    "resolution": {
      "classList": [
        "styling.baseClasses",
        "axes.size.values.*.modifier",
        "axes.content.values.*.modifier",
        "axes.intent.values.*.modifier",
        "axes.layout.values.*.modifier"
      ],
      "tokenGroups": [
        "styling.baseTokenGroups",
        "axes.*.values.*.tokenGroups"
      ]
    }
  },
  "keyboard": {
    "Escape": { "action": "close", "note": "Schliesst den Modal-Dialog." },
    "Tab": { "action": "trap-focus", "note": "Focus bleibt innerhalb des Modals (Focus Trap)." },
    "Shift+Tab": { "action": "trap-focus-reverse", "note": "Rueckwaerts-Navigation innerhalb des Focus Trap." }
  },
  "testSelectors": {
    "root": "[data-testid='modal']",
    "overlay": "[data-testid='modal-overlay']",
    "content": "[data-testid='modal-content']",
    "close": "[data-testid='modal-close']",
    "header": "[data-testid='modal-header']",
    "body": "[data-testid='modal-body']",
    "footer": "[data-testid='modal-footer']"
  },
  "events": {
    "modal-open": { "bubbles": true, "note": "Gefeuert wenn der Modal geoeffnet wird." },
    "modal-close": { "bubbles": true, "detail": { "reason": "string" }, "note": "Gefeuert beim Schliessen. Reason: 'escape', 'overlay-click', 'close-button', 'programmatic'." }
  },
  "specimens": [
    {
      "id": "default",
      "label": "Default Modal",
      "description": "Standard Modal mit Header, Body und Footer (md, default intent)",
      "matrix": {
        "axes": {
          "size": [
            "md"
          ],
          "content": [
            "full"
          ],
          "intent": [
            "default"
          ]
        },
        "states": [
          "default"
        ]
      },
      "layout": "row",
      "render": {
        "compositionType": "modal-default",
        "label": "default"
      },
      "a11y": {
        "contrastTarget": "WCAG AA normal text (4.5:1)",
        "note": "aria-labelledby auf Title. Close-Button: aria-label='Schliessen'. ESC schliesst."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "size-variants",
      "label": "Size Variants",
      "description": "SM (400px), MD (560px), LG (720px), Full (100%)",
      "matrix": {
        "axes": {
          "size": "*",
          "content": [
            "with-header"
          ],
          "intent": [
            "default"
          ]
        },
        "states": [
          "default"
        ]
      },
      "layout": "grid",
      "layoutConfig": {
        "rowAxis": "size"
      },
      "render": {
        "label": "{size}"
      },
      "a11y": {
        "contrastTarget": "WCAG AA normal text (4.5:1)",
        "note": "Alle Groessen: gleiche A11y. Full: max-width 100%, volle Hoehe."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "content-variants",
      "label": "Content Variants",
      "description": "Simple, With Header, With Footer, Full, Scrollable",
      "matrix": {
        "axes": {
          "size": [
            "md"
          ],
          "content": "*",
          "intent": [
            "default"
          ]
        },
        "states": [
          "default"
        ]
      },
      "layout": "grid",
      "layoutConfig": {
        "rowAxis": "content"
      },
      "render": {
        "label": "{content}"
      },
      "a11y": {
        "contrastTarget": "WCAG AA normal text (4.5:1)",
        "note": "Simple: aria-label statt aria-labelledby. Scrollable: Sticky Header/Footer."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "scrollable",
      "label": "Scrollable Body",
      "description": "Langer Inhalt scrollt im Body. Header und Footer bleiben sticky. Scroll-Borders erscheinen dynamisch.",
      "matrix": {
        "axes": {
          "size": [
            "md"
          ],
          "content": [
            "scrollable"
          ],
          "intent": [
            "default"
          ]
        },
        "states": [
          "default"
        ]
      },
      "layout": "row",
      "render": {
        "compositionType": "modal-scrollable",
        "label": "scrollable"
      },
      "a11y": {
        "contrastTarget": "WCAG AA normal text (4.5:1)",
        "note": "Body: overflow-y:auto. Header/Footer bleiben fixiert. Scroll per Tastatur."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "danger-confirmation",
      "label": "Danger Confirmation",
      "description": "Destruktive Bestaetigung mit rotem Header-Icon und roter primaerer Action.",
      "matrix": {
        "axes": {
          "size": [
            "sm"
          ],
          "content": [
            "full"
          ],
          "intent": [
            "danger"
          ]
        },
        "states": [
          "default"
        ]
      },
      "layout": "row",
      "render": {
        "compositionType": "modal-danger",
        "label": "danger"
      },
      "a11y": {
        "contrastTarget": "WCAG AA normal text (4.5:1)",
        "note": "Danger-Farbe 4.5:1 Kontrast. Label muss destruktive Aktion klar benennen."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "with-form",
      "label": "Modal with Form",
      "description": "Modal mit eingebettetem Formular",
      "composes": [
        "form",
        "form-field",
        "form-actions"
      ],
      "matrix": {
        "axes": {
          "size": [
            "md"
          ],
          "content": [
            "full"
          ],
          "intent": [
            "default"
          ]
        },
        "states": [
          "default"
        ]
      },
      "layout": "row",
      "render": {
        "compositionType": "modal-form",
        "label": "form"
      },
      "a11y": {
        "contrastTarget": "WCAG AA normal text (4.5:1)",
        "note": "Formular im Modal: Tab-Navigation durch Fields. Submit im Footer. Backdrop-Close NICHT aktivieren."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "mobile-bottom-sheet",
      "label": "Mobile Bottom-Sheet",
      "description": "Responsive Transformation: Modal wird auf Mobile zum Bottom-Sheet (volle Breite, von unten).",
      "matrix": {
        "axes": {
          "size": [
            "md"
          ],
          "content": [
            "full"
          ],
          "intent": [
            "default"
          ]
        },
        "states": [
          "default"
        ]
      },
      "layout": "row",
      "render": {
        "compositionType": "modal-bottom-sheet",
        "label": "bottom-sheet"
      },
      "a11y": {
        "contrastTarget": "WCAG AA normal text (4.5:1)",
        "note": "Bottom-Sheet: Gleiche A11y wie zentriertes Modal. ESC + Close-Button. Optional: Swipe-to-dismiss."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "sheet",
      "label": "Bottom-Sheet (Modifier)",
      "description": "nc-modal--sheet: Bottom-Sheet auf jeder Fensterbreite — volle Breite, unten angedockt, obere Ecken gerundet. Dieselben Regeln wie die automatische Umschaltung unter sm.",
      "matrix": {
        "axes": {
          "size": [
            "md"
          ],
          "content": [
            "full"
          ],
          "intent": [
            "default"
          ],
          "layout": [
            "sheet"
          ]
        },
        "states": [
          "default"
        ]
      },
      "layout": "row",
      "render": {
        "compositionType": "modal-sheet",
        "label": "sheet"
      },
      "a11y": {
        "contrastTarget": "WCAG AA normal text (4.5:1)",
        "note": "Gleiche A11y wie das zentrierte Modal: <dialog> mit showModal(), ESC + Close-Button, Fokus-Falle, Fokus zurueck."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "backdrop-close",
      "label": "Backdrop Close",
      "description": "Klick auf Backdrop schliesst Modal. Optional via data-backdrop-close='true'.",
      "matrix": {
        "axes": {
          "size": [
            "md"
          ],
          "content": [
            "full"
          ],
          "intent": [
            "default"
          ]
        },
        "states": [
          "default"
        ]
      },
      "layout": "row",
      "render": {
        "compositionType": "modal-backdrop-close",
        "label": "backdrop-close"
      },
      "a11y": {
        "contrastTarget": "WCAG AA normal text (4.5:1)",
        "note": "Backdrop-Close optional — NICHT bei Formularen (Datenverlust). Nutzer muss Close-Button oder ESC als Alternative haben."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "overlay-hierarchy",
      "label": "Overlay Hierarchy",
      "description": "Vergleich der Schatten-Hierarchie: Dropdown (Level 1) → Popover (Level 2) → Modal (Level 3)",
      "matrix": {
        "axes": {
          "size": [
            "sm"
          ],
          "content": [
            "with-header"
          ],
          "intent": [
            "default"
          ]
        },
        "states": [
          "default"
        ]
